{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38668","headline":"寄献山中顾公员外 · 李昭象","name":"寄献山中顾公员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"抽却朝簪着钓蓑，近来声迹转巍峩。\n祥麟避网虽山野，丹凤衔书即薜萝。\n乍隐文章情更逸，久闲经济术翻多。\n深慙未副吹嘘力，竟困风埃争奈何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李昭象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38668.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38668","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}